# ThreadSanitizer suppressions.
#
# FFTW is linked uninstrumented, so ThreadSanitizer cannot observe the
# synchronisation inside it. Where FFTWpp serialises planner calls with its
# own mutex, TSan still sees FFTW's internal reads and writes as unordered
# and reports them. Suppressing FFTW's own frames leaves the reports that
# concern this library's synchronisation, which is what the planner
# serialisation tests are there to check.
called_from_lib:libfftw3
called_from_lib:libfftw3f
called_from_lib:libfftw3l
